<title>JAPAN: Japan key 3-mth CDs rate rises to 0.60 pct-traders.</title>
<headline>Japan key 3-mth CDs rate rises to 0.60 pct-traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's key three-month certificates of deposit (CD) rate rose to 0.60 percent in Tuesday morning trade, the first time it has hit that level since August 20, 1996, traders said.</p>
</text>
